1.3 "Rusty Client" or the "Software" means the Rusty Client launcher, the Rusty Client Setup program (RustyClient-Setup.exe), the uninstaller, the Rusty Client in-game client (the Fabric mod that the launcher loads into Minecraft, rustyclient-26.x.jar), every test build (such as Test-RustyClient.exe) and all of their components, including every update, upgrade, fix, patch, new version, configuration file, image, logo, icon, text, layout, design, documentation and any other material that the Developer provides together with or for Rusty Client, in source code or in object code form.

