1.5 "Minecraft" means Minecraft: Java Edition, its game files, its servers and all related services operated by Mojang AB and Microsoft Corporation ("Mojang" and "Microsoft"). Minecraft is not part of Rusty Client.

1.6 "Downloaded Mods" means Fabric Loader, Fabric API, Sodium, Lithium, FerriteCore, ImmediatelyFast, EntityCulling and any other mod that the launcher downloads from its official source on your computer. Downloaded Mods are not part of Rusty Client.

