A.6 Rust crates

The launcher is built with Rust crates from crates.io, among them cef, cef-dll-sys, tokio, reqwest, serde, serde_json, zstd, zip, bzip2, tar, sha1, hex, uuid, base64, url, futures-util, windows and windows-sys. They are used under their own licenses, mainly the MIT License, the Apache License 2.0 and the BSD licenses. The complete list with exact versions is in the file Cargo.lock of the Rusty Client repository, and each crate's license is available on https://crates.io.


